  E4:4 A4 C#5 B4:2.~8. C5:16 E5:1 B4:1~4 D4:4 G4 B4 A4:1 D5:2.~8. Eb5:16 A4:2.~8. Bb4:16
  Ab4:2.~8. A4:16 B4:2.~8. C5:16 Bb4:1 R (Ab4:8. Bb4:8 B4:2.~8. C5:16 Bb4:8. C#5 B4:16 C5
