  B4:2.~8. C5:16 Bb4:8. C#5 B4:16 C5 Bb4:8 B4:16 Ab4:8. Bb4:8 B4:2.~8. C5:16 Bb4:8. C#5:8 B4
  C5:16 Bb4:8 B4:16 Ab4:8. Bb4:8 B4:2.~8. Bb4:4 C#5:8. B4:16 Bb4:8. B4:16 Ab4:1 Bb4:2.~8. B4:16
  Eb5:1~4 F#4:4 B4 Eb5 C#5:1 F#5 C#5:1~4 E4:4 A4 C#5 B4:2.~8. C5:16 E5:1 B4:1~4 D4:4 G4 B4 A4:1
